{"seq":41,"slug":"organizational-knowledge-systems","title":"组织知识管理系统","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":17,"url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 组织知识管理系统 简介\n\n组织知识管理（Knowledge Management, KM）是将组织中分散在个人头脑、文档系统、业务流程和日常实践里的知识，系统性地捕获、结构化、分享和复用的管理实践。对技术组织而言，知识管理的直接产出是更快的新人上手、更低的关键人物风险、更高的问题解决效率和更可持续的创新能力——它不是\"写文档\"这么简单，而是一套从理论到工具、从流程到文化的系统工程。\n\n本知识库面向三类核心读者：**技术管理者**（Tech Lead、工程经理）需要理解如何通过知识管理提升团队生产力和抗风险能力；**HRBP 与组织发展从业者**需要掌握知识留存与传承的方法论来应对人才流动挑战；**知识工程师与 KM 平台负责人**需要从系统建设和技术选型的角度获得可落地的实践指南。全书以工程师的视角组织内容——强调结构化、可度量、可执行，避免空泛的管理口号。\n\n全书共分四个章节，沿四条主线展开：\n\n第一章**组织知识管理基础**从经典理论框架入手，深入 SECI 知识转化模型、Wiig 知识管理框架和 Choo 信息管理模型，阐明隐性知识与显性知识的本质区别与转化机制，以及知识在组织内部的流动路径与障碍。这是理解后续所有实践内容的概念地基。\n\n第二章**知识管理系统建设**聚焦\"用什么工具、建什么系统\"。从 Wiki/知识库的信息架构设计与内容生命周期管理，到实践社区（CoP）的运营方法与专家网络建设，再到 KM 平台的选型决策框架与系统集成策略，帮助你根据组织规模和需求选择最合适的技术方案。\n\n第三章**知识留存与传承**解决\"人走了知识怎么办\"的核心问题。涵盖专家知识捕获的访谈与工作坊技术、新人 Onboarding 的结构化知识传递框架（30-60-90 天计划），以及离职流程中的知识交接与关键岗位风险控制——这一章直接对应组织最痛的知识流失场景。\n\n第四章**KM 文化与度量**回答\"如何让 KM 持续运转\"。从心理安全与激励机制入手讨论知识分享文化的建设路径，建立包含输入-过程-输出-成果的四层 KM 指标体系并讲解 ROI 计算方法，最后阐述知识治理的组织架构、角色职责和持续运营机制。\n\n建议首次阅读按章节顺序进行：基础理论提供概念框架，系统建设对应工具落地，知识留存解决具体痛点，文化度量确保长期可持续。如果你正面临紧迫的知识流失问题，可以直接跳到第三章；如果正在规划 KM 平台采购，第二章是首选入口。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"org-km-foundations","title":"第一章：组织知识管理基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/org-km-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"km-theory-frameworks","title":"知识管理理论与框架","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/org-km-foundations/km-theory-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tacit-explicit-knowledge","title":"隐性知识与显性知识","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/org-km-foundations/tacit-explicit-knowledge"},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-flows","title":"组织内知识流动","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/org-km-foundations/knowledge-flows"},{"seq":4,"slug":"knowledge-flow-barriers-mechanisms-metrics","title":"知识流动的障碍、机制与度量","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/org-km-foundations/knowledge-flow-barriers-mechanisms-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"km-systems","title":"知识管理系统建设","docCount":5,"url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wiki-knowledge-base","title":"Wiki 与企业知识库系统","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-systems/wiki-knowledge-base"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wiki-templates-and-governance","title":"知识库模板设计与治理体系","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-systems/wiki-templates-and-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"community-of-practice","title":"实践社区与专家网络","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-systems/community-of-practice"},{"seq":4,"slug":"km-platform-selection","title":"KM 平台选型与集成","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-systems/km-platform-selection"},{"seq":5,"slug":"km-platform-trends","title":"KM 平台技术趋势与知识健康度","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-systems/km-platform-trends"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-retention","title":"知识留存与传承","docCount":4,"url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/knowledge-retention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"expert-knowledge-capture","title":"专家知识捕获方法","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/knowledge-retention/expert-knowledge-capture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-knowledge-transfer","title":"新人入职知识传递","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/knowledge-retention/onboarding-knowledge-transfer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"onboarding-program-and-roles","title":"入职项目与角色设计","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/knowledge-retention/onboarding-program-and-roles"},{"seq":4,"slug":"departure-knowledge-retention","title":"离职知识留存策略","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/knowledge-retention/departure-knowledge-retention"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"km-culture-metrics","title":"KM 文化与度量","docCount":4,"url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-culture-metrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"knowledge-sharing-culture","title":"知识分享文化建设","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-culture-metrics/knowledge-sharing-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"km-metrics-roi","title":"KM 度量与 ROI","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-culture-metrics/km-metrics-roi"},{"seq":3,"slug":"km-governance","title":"知识治理与持续运营","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-culture-metrics/km-governance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"km-governance-operations-platform","title":"知识治理的持续运营与技术治理","url":"/h/management/organizational-knowledge-systems/km-culture-metrics/km-governance-operations-platform"}]}]}